[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7385.669, "timestamp": "02:03:05", "text": "你有餐巾纸吗？是的。是的。有时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7387.109, "timestamp": "02:03:07", "text": "当你用餐巾捂住鼻子时，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7389.99, "timestamp": "02:03:09", "text": "它就像能止住打喷嚏一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7393.03, "timestamp": "02:03:13", "text": "继续。是的。是的。它一直在继续"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7397.109, "timestamp": "02:03:17", "text": "我打喷嚏的时候老是打喷嚏，呃呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7401.27, "timestamp": "02:03:21", "text": "怎么说？那是鼻子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7404.31, "timestamp": "02:03:24", "text": "你的鼻子？是的。用餐巾纸。喜欢"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 7405.914, "timestamp": "02:03:25", "author": "@kaiguyniki", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/f9aZERpOc1bv1JDUl12ZTXeQ7j1KdXBflkbl-6qlBLzM-hbbEQKWUlPpcJJxTU-qSUwNxrez=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "joqsneex"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7408.31, "timestamp": "02:03:28", "text": "呃，擤鼻涕的时候。不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7411.669, "timestamp": "02:03:31", "text": "就像挠鼻子一样。是的。呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7414.629, "timestamp": "02:03:34", "text": "清理鼻子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7418.629, "timestamp": "02:03:38", "text": "哦，是的。是的。是的。所以在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7423.189, "timestamp": "02:03:43", "text": "让它更像“如何做”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7425.99, "timestamp": "02:03:45", "text": "呃，有点恼火之类的。鼻子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7428.87, "timestamp": "02:03:48", "text": "里面会是这样的：是的。你必须"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7431.83, "timestamp": "02:03:51", "text": "我要让你的喷嚏更响亮。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7435.27, "timestamp": "02:03:55", "text": "就像那样，然后就开始漏水了，或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7436.95, "timestamp": "02:03:56", "text": "某物。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7439.109, "timestamp": "02:03:59", "text": "哦，是的。是的。是的。是的。我不知道"}]